$$$$$      DO NOT RECOMPILE THIS PROGRAM.  THIS NEEDS TO BE COMPILED $$
$$$$$      AT A PRE H01 RELEASE OF CSIS/MMIS.  FOR RELEASE H01 AND   $$
$$$$$      AND ABOVE, USE THE TPOHPRNT OBJECT.                       $$
$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$
$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$
000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TPOHPRNT.
000400 AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.  MAR. 21, 1988.
000700
000800***********************************************************
000900**                                                       **
001000**    T P O H P R N T                                    **
001100**                                                       **
001200**   THIS PROGRAM PRINTS ALL PURCHASE ORDER, RECEIPT,    **
001300**   AND INVOICE INFORMATION ON A PARTICULAR PURCHASE    **
001400**   ORDER THAT HAS BEEN DELETED FROM THE HISTORY DATA   **
001500**   BASE AND SAVED IN AN MPE FILE 'POHIST01'.  THIS     **
001600**   FILE 'POHIST01' IS SAVED TO TAPE AND RESTORED       **
001700**   ONTO THE SYSTEM WHEN A USER WISHES TO PRINT INFO.   **
001800**   ON A DESIRED PO.  THE CORRECT TAPE CONTAINING THE   **
001900**   PURCHASE ORDER MUST BE RESTORED.  THE DELETION      **
002000**   DATE FROM HISTORY WILL BE PROVIDED BY THE USER      **
002100**   SO THE CORRECT TAPE CAN BE USED TO DO THE RESTORE.  **
002200**                                                       **
002300**       XRSCREEN REPORT NO. - 85                        **
002400**       REPORT HEADER       - DHDRPT85.PUB              **
002500**       FORM FILE IN FRSCREEN - POHPRNT                 **
002600**                                                       **
002700***********************************************************
002800
002900
003000 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
003100 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
003200 SOURCE-COMPUTER.   HP-3000.
003300 OBJECT-COMPUTER.   HP-3000.
003400 SPECIAL-NAMES.  C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
003600
003700 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
003800 FILE-CONTROL.
003900     SELECT ONLINE-PRT ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
004000     SELECT PO-HISTORY-FILE ASSIGN TO DISK-POHIST01.
004100
004200 DATA DIVISION.
004300 FILE SECTION.
004400
004500 FD  ONLINE-PRT
004600     DATA RECORD IS PRT-REC
004700     RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS
004800     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
004900 01  PRT-REC                       PIC X(133).
005000
005100********************************************************
005200**
005300**   FILE NAME IS 'POHIST01' AND IS VARIABLE IN LENGTH
005400**   FROM 54 TO 520 BYTES
005500**
005600********************************************************
005700
005800 FD  PO-HISTORY-FILE
006000     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
006100     DATA RECORD IS PO-HISTORY-REC.
006200 01  PO-HISTORY-REC.
006300     05  PO-HIST-PO-NUM.
006400         10  PO-HIST-PO-REL       PIC X(10).
006500         10  FILLER               PIC X(4).
006600     05  PO-HIST-DSET-NAME        PIC X(10).
006700     05  PO-HIST-DATA             PIC X(496).
006800
006900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
007000 77  END-OF-FILE-SW               PIC X(1)     VALUE SPACES.
007100 77  PAGE-CTR                     PIC 9(4) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
007200 77  LINE-CTR                     PIC 9(4) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
007300 77  FIRST-RCVR-RECORD            PIC X(1)     VALUE SPACES.
007400 77  FIRST-INV-RECORD             PIC X(1)     VALUE SPACES.
007500 77  CE-SUB                       PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
007600 77  TAX-SUB                      PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
007700 77  FOUND-CE-AMT-SW              PIC X(1)     VALUE SPACES.
007800 77  FOUND-ACCRUED-TAX-SW         PIC X(1)     VALUE SPACES.
007900 77  PO-FOUND-SW                  PIC X(1)     VALUE SPACES.
008000
008500 01  BUILD-DPORECD-BUFFER.
008600     05  DPORECD-DATA             PIC X(192).
008700     05  DVENDOR-NAME             PIC X(44).
