061600
061700     PERFORM 1-HSK  THRU  1-HSK-X.
061800     PERFORM 6-MAIN  THRU  6-MAIN-X.
061900**** PERFORM 2-CLOSE-FILES  THRU  2-CLOSE-FILES-X.
062000     GOBACK.
062100
062200
062300 1-HSK.
